# ---------------------------------
#   Which runners KRunner ranks first.
#
# KRunner sorts the categories of its favourite runners above every other
# category, in the order this list names them, whatever relevance a row
# carries. `kdos` leads, so `night light` + Enter runs the palette's verb
# rather than an application whose name happens to start with the same
# letters; the rest is KRunner's own default order. `kdos-library` is not a
# favourite: the offline library answers below everything else. A runner id
# here is an interface (kdos-runner's kdos.desktop); renaming it drops the
# palette back below Applications and System Settings.
# ---------------------------------

[Plugins][Favorites]
